      "summary": "Hi!\nEvery month the \"Who Wants to Be Hired?\" and \"Who's Hiring?\" Threads come through I would think to myself, \"there should be a match maker for these two threads\".\nSo I had abacus.ai whip one up. The methodology is pretty simple, data is extracted from posts using an LLM, score matches based on salary, domain experience, remote/onsite, etc., and then eliminate incompatible postings, like 'lookin",
