      "id": "bbc-2026-09-01-family-mourn-deeply-loved-girl-killed-in-middlesbrough-fire",
      "title": "Family mourn 'deeply loved' girl killed in Middlesbrough fire",
      "summary": "Valentina Foster's parents say their lives were changed forever by her \"devastating loss\".",
      "body": "The family of a seven-year-old girl killed in a house fire said their lives had been changed forever by her \"devastating loss\".Valentina Foster died alongside her aunt Natalie McDonald, 34, in the blaze at Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in the early hours of 26 August. A man has been charged with their murders.In a tribute, the youngster's parents said their daughter would \"always be in our hearts, and her memory will live with us forever\".\"She was deeply loved and will be missed beyond words by her family, friends, and everyone whose life she touched,\" they said.\"Our lives have changed forever, and we are struggling to come to terms with this devastating loss.\"They added she would be \"forever missed\" by her brothers and sisters.",
      "source": "BBC",
      "category": "world",
