 CitizensGovStar is hiring 5 engineers to help build secure, production-grade AI and advanced analytics capabilities supporting U.S. national security missions.• AI Engineer — AI/ML engineering; Python, LLMs, RAG, embeddings/vector retrieval, orchestration, evaluation, guardrails, Azure AI/OpenAI.• Full Stack AI Developer — Python + React/TypeScript; secure APIs, AI-enabled applications, enterprise data integrations, Azure, CI/CD.• Frontend Engineer — React + TypeScript; accessible, responsive interfaces for enterprise AI applications and secure backend/AI integrations.• SRE Platform Engineer — Azure, Terraform, observability, CI/CD, containers/Kubernetes, incident response, platform reliability, and DevSecOps.• Cloud Automation Engineer — Azure + Terraform; infrastructure automation, CI/CD, Docker/Kubernetes, GitHub Enterprise, deployment, and operational automation.Required for all roles:U.S. citizenship • Currently residing in the U.S. • Eastern or Central Time Zone • Ability to obtain and maintain a government clearance.Compensation will vary based on role, experience, and qualifications. We’re happy to discuss compensation expectations early in the process so neither side wastes time.GovStar benefits include medical, dental, and vision coverage; 401(k) matching; paid time off; and an employee shares program.To apply, email your resume and GitHub profile to nicholas.hanson@govstar.usPlease mention “Hacker News” in the subject line.\nAshby | YC 19 | REMOTE | Hiring Senior/Staff Product Engineers (Americas) | $178k–$299kAshby is the all-in-one recruiting platform powering hiring at the world's most innovative companies. If you cmd+f \"Ashby\" you'll see that we're powering many of the job postings in this thread!As we scale our platform, we are also looking to scale our Product Engineering team.Why Join?High Seniority & Density: 80%+ of our engineering team is Senior–Staff+ level. You’ll be working alongside peers who excel at navigating ambiguity and setting high