      "body": "31 Aug 2026Tri Cities Airport BasementBlountville, TNThis restroom, or what's left of it, is located on the basement level of the Tri Cities Regional Airport. Despite its appearance, the restroom is unlocked and accessible to the public. This was originally a secondary restroom located near a storage space, likely only for workers when it was functional. The toilets and urinals have since been stripped away, and what remains are old pipes and a crusty sink. The windows lead to shafts that open up to the street level while a lone hole under the sink leads down a dark and empty crawl space, corroded by time30 Aug 2026Paulie Gee's Slice ShopBrooklyn, NY29 Aug 2026Grand Army Plaza Automatic Public ToiletBrooklyn, NY23 Aug 2026The Met CloistersManhattan, NY22 Aug 2026Terrace Coffee ShopBrooklyn, NY21 Aug 2026Vol de NuitManhattan, NY17 Aug 2026NishaanManhattan, NY01 Aug 2026Cafe MogadorBrooklyn, NY04 Jul 2026BoatBrooklyn, NY30 Jun 2026The Farmhouse PeddlerOrem, UT28 Jun 2026Skylight Lake PowellBig Water, AZ10 Jun 2026Paddy's of Park SlopeBrooklyn, NY27 May 2026Qiujiang Road Electronic MarketShanghai, CN20 May 2026Nighclub 101Manhattan, NY01 May 2026LucaliBrooklyn, NY14 Apr 2026Tracy Aviary at Liberty ParkSalt Lake City, UT11 Apr 2026Gypsy Emporium Antique MallHurricane, UT10 Apr 2026Slice of VeyoVeyo, Utah30 Dec 2025Cuppa HiveBrooklyn, NY07 Dec 2025V-Nam CafeManhattan, NY11 Nov 2025Secret Riso ClubBrooklyn, NY01 Nov 2025Public RecordsBrooklyn, NY29 Oct 2025Souvlaki GR – Midtown WestManhattan, NY24 Oct 2025The Good Fork PubBrooklyn, NY14 Oct 2025Saint EvesBrooklyn, NY10 Oct 2025Cuban ShackBrooklyn, NY13 Aug 2025Boutique des Catacombes de ParisParis, FR10 Aug 2025Paris Charles de Gaulle AirportRoissy-en-France, FR05 Aug 2025Unnameable BooksBrooklyn, NY17 Jul 2025Pace GalleryManhattan, NY04 Jul 2025Edie Jo'sBrooklyn, NY07 Jun 2025Treasures Antique Mall southSpringville, UT31 May 202581 Prospect StBrooklyn, NY27 May 2025Hex HouseBrooklyn, NY27 May 2025Greenwood