      "id": "theverge-2026-08-29-alt-right-troll-milo-yiannopoulos-has-been-deported",
      "title": "Alt-right troll Milo Yiannopoulos has been deported",
      "summary": "Alt-right troll Milo Yiannopoulos was arrested by ICE on Thursday, and today the Department of Homeland Security confirmed to Reuters and The Washington Post that he had been deported to the UK. Yiannopoulos came to the US legally in 2019, but overstayed his visa. After he failed to appear in court for an immigration hearing, a final order of removal was issued ​on July 22.\nThe British national ma",
      "body": "Alt-right troll Milo Yiannopoulos was arrested by ICE on Thursday, and today the Department of Homeland Security confirmed to Reuters and The Washington Post that he had been deported to the UK. Yiannopoulos came to the US legally in 2019, but overstayed his visa. After he failed to appear in court for an immigration hearing, a final order of removal was issued ​on July 22.\nThe British national made a name for himself as an editor at Steve Bannon’s Breitbart and an early supporter of Donald Trump’s. He has had a long history of controversial statements and associations, including reportedly helping arrange Trump’s dinner with Kanye West and white nationalist Nick Fuentes, and he was a key figure in the online harassment campaign Gamergate.\nIn recent years, however, his antics have led to a falling out with most significant figures on the right, including MAGA influencer Laura Loomer. He has denied condoning statutory rape or pedophilia, but he has suggested it’s acceptable for an adult to have a sexual relationship with a 13-year-old.\nThere’s no word if the 44 interns in a trenchcoat who also constitute the entity known as Milo Yiannopoulos have also been deported.",
      "source": "The Verge",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [
        "News",
        "Policy",
        "Politics"
      ],
      "author": "Terrence O’Brien",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-29T19:49:59.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/13604714/milopatreon.jpeg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,7.6388888888889,100,69.808027923211",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/policy/986456/milo-yiannopoulos-deported-ice",
      "readTimeMinutes": 1,
      "language": "en"
    },
