      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/02/268364_Inside_Microsofts_big_Xbox_leadership_shakeup_CVirginia.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,10.732984293194,100,78.534031413613",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/games/986337/xbox-ceo-asha-sharma-project-helix-family-of-devices",
