      "id": "bbc-2026-08-28-terrorist-connection-included-in-charges-over-vandalism-at-t",
      "title": "'Terrorist connection' included in charges over vandalism at Trump's Scottish golf resort",
      "summary": "Seven people accused of causing damage at Trump's resort could receive longer sentences if convicted.",
      "body": "Kieran Robson, 35, Uzma Bashir, 56, Ricky Southall, 34, Autumn Taylor Ward, 22, Rebecca Sian Davies, 29, John Moxley, 58, and Dylan Chiaramello, 24, were all charged with criminal damage following the protest. It is alleged the group dug up turf and sprayed weedkiller on the course, caused flooding by damaging a sprinkler system, and damaged a light.Prosecutors also allege that slogans including \"Free Gaza\", \"Free Palestine\" and  \"Gaza is not for sale\" were daubed on the course and buildings, along with offensive messages directed at Trump.The seven were due to appear at the High Court in Glasgow next Monday, but the Scottish Courts and Tribunals Service said on Friday that the hearing had been adjourned, with the next hearing due to take place in October.",
