        "Tech"
      ],
      "author": "Stevie Bonifield",
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-28T13:47:36.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/02/Severance_Photo_021019.jpg?quality=90&strip=all&crop=10.208333333333,0,79.583333333333,100",
