      "id": "bbc-2026-08-27-optimus-prime-and-eeyore-voice-actor-peter-cullen-dies",
      "title": "Optimus Prime and Eeyore voice actor Peter Cullen dies",
      "summary": "Cullen voiced the heroic Optimus Prime in the Transformers TV series and then the Hollywood films.",
      "body": "His Optimus Prime voice was inspired by his older brother, a decorated US Marine and Vietnam War veteran, who suggested he should play the character as \"a real hero, don't be a Hollywood hero\".\"He said, 'Don't go yelling and screaming. He's strong enough to be gentle.'\"And that resonated with me, and I could hear his voice all the way to the audition. When he drops down, when he gets serious, is where I found Optimus Prime.\"Cullen gave his brother a cut of the wages he received for playing Optimus Prime until his death.The actor's performance as the character earned him a Daytime Emmy nomination for outstanding performer in an animated programme in 2011, and he was honoured with a lifetime achievement award at the Children's & Family Emmy Awards in 2023.Cullen's other roles included Monterey Jack in Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers, and he voiced characters in 1980s and 90s animated series including Spider-Man, Donkey Kong, Alvin & the Chipmunks, Dungeons & Dragons, My Little Pony, Duck Tales and Gummi Bears.",
