      "id": "theverge-2026-08-26-amazon-knocks-150-off-pixel-11-phones-with-up-to-200-in-gift",
      "title": "Amazon knocks $150 off Pixel 11 phones, with up to $200 in gift cards",
      "summary": "The Pixel 11 in hibiscus. | Image: The Verge\t\n\nIf you’ve been on the fence about Google’s latest Pixel phones, this might be your best chance to save some cash. Amazon is offering an extra $150 off the Pixel 11, Pixel 11 Pro, and Pixel 11 Pro XL when you use the coupon code PIXEL11 at checkout. While the discounted price appeared at checkout for most phone and watch combinations, it didn’t apply t",
      "body": "If you’ve been on the fence about Google’s latest Pixel phones, this might be your best chance to save some cash. Amazon is offering an extra $150 off the Pixel 11, Pixel 11 Pro, and Pixel 11 Pro XL when you use the coupon code PIXEL11 at checkout. While the discounted price appeared at checkout for most phone and watch combinations, it didn’t apply to the Pixel Pro Fold.\nThat deal stacks with the introductory offer running at several retailers, where you can choose between a gift card that scales with the model of phone you’re buying, or additional credit towards a Pixel Watch 5. For example, the base model Pixel 11 would normally cost $899, but the introductory bundle, which ends on August 27th, includes a $100 gift card, and with the code, you’ll pay just $749. The Pixel 11 Pro and Pro XL bundles include either a $200 gift card, or $250 towards the cost of a Pixel Watch 5.\n[Product: Google Pixel 11 | https://www.amazon.com/Google-Pixel-11-Unlocked-Smartphone/dp/B0HBF7RD17?tag=theverge02-20]\nThe Pixel 11 phones added a variety of new features to Google’s first-party Android phones, most notably around the cameras. In addition to improved sensors across the lineup, the new Magic Capture feature automatically pulls photos and clips out of a video recording, letting you focus on what’s in front of you.\nRead our Pixel 11 and Pixel 11 Pro reviews.\n* Doom: The Dark Ages is on sale for $19.87 at Green Man Gaming, the lowest price yet for the Steam version of the game. The 2025 title adds a medieval twist to the classic Doom formula, with a more engaging story, and of course an awesome suite of weapons, including a shield that gives you more options while charging into battle. Read our review.\n* Best Buy is selling the Scuf Valor Pro for $113.99, a significant discount from its usual price of $189.99. This wireless controller is compatible with PC, Xbox Series S/X, and Xbox One, and features TMR joysticks to prevent stick drift over time. It has a 1,000 Hz polling rate when connected to a computer for super sharp response times, and programmable paddles on the back.\n* The Cuktech 25,000mAh 100W USB-C power bank is only $62.99 at Amazon for a limited time, 10 percent lower than the usual price. It can charge up to three devices at once, with an integrated USB-C cable, as well as USB-C and USB-A ports, with up to 100W of charging power.",
      "source": "The Verge",
      "category": "tech",
