      "body": "Up Next. Tracing the deadly path of the Nepal-Tibet flash flood. Video, 00:02:01SubsectionAsiaPublished15 hours agoWorker films moment he escapes deadly Nepal floods. Video, 00:00:51SubsectionAsiaPublished23 hours agoWhat caused the Nepal-Tibet flash floods? Video, 00:00:59SubsectionAsiaPublished21 hours agoBBC visits hospital in Kathmandu as families wait for news. Video, 00:01:55SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoHow Dolly Parton became a fashion icon. Video, 00:01:12SubsectionCulturePublished1 day agoAerial footage shows flash flood on Nepal-Tibet border. Video, 00:00:34SubsectionAsiaPublished1 day agoDolly Parton: The life of an iconic country singer. Video, 00:00:10SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished2 days agoIs UK's Storm Shadow missile a game changer for Ukraine? Video, 00:01:37SubsectionEuropePublished3 days agoRobot boxing, football and sprinting at World Humanoid Games. Video, 00:01:24SubsectionAsiaPublished4 days agoWatch: Moment humanoid robot beats Usain Bolt's 100m record. Video, 00:00:46SubsectionAsiaPublished5 days agoWatch: Taking a 180mph spin round America's birthday Grand Prix racetrack. Video, 00:01:47SubsectionUS & CanadaPublished6 days ago",
