      "publishedAt": "2026-08-25T18:26:55.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/20260511_Wet_Dress_Actual_2_259bcb3ae9.jpg?resize=1200,899",
      "originalUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/25/spacex-will-build-a-second-100b-starbase-spaceport-in-louisiana/",
